  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5601.141 \"Personal representative\" as used in RSA 260:14, I(b), means a person who manages the legal affairs of another, by evidence of a power attorney, appointment by",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5601.141 \"Personal representative\" as used in RSA 260:14, I(b), means a person who manages the legal affairs of another, by evidence of a power attorney, appointment by a court of competent jurisdiction, or representation of an attorney-client relationship.\n\nSource. #7626, EXEMPT, eff 1-17-02",
